sequenceDiagram
  actor Seller as Seller
  actor Other as Other user
  participant UI as Publish/Manage UI
  participant API as SecondhandProductController
  participant Service as SecondhandProductServiceImpl
  participant Audit as ProductRiskAuditService
  participant DB as MySQL

  Seller->>UI: Select real category and upload image
  UI->>API: POST /api/secondhand/seller
  API->>Service: createSellerProduct(request)
  Service->>DB: Validate category and insert product
  Service->>Audit: auditSecondhandProduct(productId)
  Audit->>DB: Insert product_risk_audit
  Service-->>UI: Published product

  Seller->>UI: Edit description and change shelf status
  UI->>API: PUT product / POST status
  API->>Service: Validate owner and mutable state
  Service->>DB: Persist update
  Service-->>UI: Refreshed product

  Other->>API: DELETE seller product
  API->>Service: deleteSellerProduct(productId)
  Service-->>Other: 403 ownership rejection

  Seller->>UI: Delete off-shelf product
  UI->>API: DELETE /api/secondhand/seller/{id}
  Service->>DB: Delete owned mutable product
  Service-->>UI: Product no longer visible
